# Command: [help information]
#----------------------------
[Command : lap_time]: Execution time - 000ms 000us 000ns(000000000ns)


Usage: information(info, status, i) <pm | em>

Discription:
    Display information of Projection Matrix(pm) or preloaded embeddings data(em).

    This command displays information regarding the Projection Matrix and embedding data held internally by this
    program.

    The Projection Matrix includes "builtin" data integrated into the k2hvec library.
    This data can be replaced using the "load_projection_matrix(pm)" or "create_projection_matrix(cpm)" commands.

    The embedding data can be stored internally as preloaded data using the "load_embedding(em)" or
    "create_embedding(cem)" commands.
    While embedding data can be specified via a file when executing commands such as "create_main_key(key)",
    "create_binary_hash(cbh)", or "calculate_cos(cos)", storing it as preloaded data allows it to be used in
    place of a file.

