Usage: common_config(common_conf, comconf, cc) [cal_bit_size=<bit count | "default">] [neighbor_key_limit=<limit | "default">] [content_direct_limit=<limit | "default">]

Discription:
    Set or Print the Vecotr Search keys configuration about the Binary Hash bit count for embedding data and
    the maximum number of neighbor keys used during search.

    Use the "cal_bit_size" parameter to specify the bit size used when calculating the BinaryHash
    from embedding data. Specify "default" to reset it to the k2hvec library's default value.

    Use the "neighbor_key_limit" parameter to specify the maximum number of neighbor keys used during search.
    Specify "default" to reset it to the k2hvec library's default value.

    Use the "content_direct_limit" parameter to specify the maximum size for saving content text directly to
    the main key.
    Specify "default" to reset it to the k2hvec library's default value.

    If called without any parameters, the currently configured values will be displayed.

