    k2hvec library.

    The k2hvec library maintains an internal Projection Matrix, it includes a built-in Projection Matrix
    known as "builtin" by default.
    This command overwrites and replaces the Projection Matrix held by the k2hvec library.

    The Projection Matrix held by the k2hvec library can be verified using the "information(i)" or
    "dump(dmp)" commands.

