Usage: create_embedding(create_em, cem) [dimension=<dimension | "default">] [output=<output file>]

Discription:
    Create an Embedding data, and either load it as preloaded data in this program or save it to
    "<output file>".

    If the generated embedding data will be loaded as the preloaded data, do not specify "<output file>".
    If it is specified arguments after "<output file>", the generated  embedding data will be output to
    "<output file>" without loading as the preloaded data.

    Each argument follows the specifications below:
      <dimension>    Specify the dimension of Projection Matrix as a decimal number. If omit it or specify
                     "deffault"(def), use the default value(4096).
                     (The alias for this option is "dim" and "d".)
      <output>       Specify a file path when saving the generated embedding data.

    Each argument is optional.

